  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Moderates and Bright Armenia prepartory study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The preparatory study aims to establish a strong foundation for collaboration between youth organizations in Denmark and Armenia, with a focus on fostering democratic participation among young people. The study will explore challenges to youth involvement, assess opportunities for civic education, and define a pilot project addressing low political participation, hate speech, and gender imbalance. The proposed project seeks to empower Armenian youth (18&#xfffd;30) and mid-career women through training, workshops, and dialogue platforms. Objectives include equipping participants with democratic skills, promoting inclusive political engagement, and building long-term cooperation between the partner organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
